### Fazer login
POST http://localhost:3001/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin1_company1@example.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Dados do usuário
GET http://localhost:3001/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}

### Buscar veículos
GET http://localhost:3001/vehicles
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}


### Buscar ordens de um veículo
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/plate/QQX4012XZ
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}

### Buscar veículo pela placa
GET http://localhost:3001/vehicles/QQX4012XZ
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}

### Buscar todas as branchs
GET http://localhost:3001/branchs/
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}

### Criar novo veículo
POST http://localhost:3001/vehicles
Cookie: {{Cookie2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "ABC-1234",
  "branchId": 31,
  "model": "Civic",
  "brand": "Honda",
  "modelYear": 2023,
  "manufactureYear": 2022,
  "color": "Preto",
  "renavam": "12345678901",
  "chassis": "9BWZZZ377VT004251",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "mileageStart": 0
}